{"title": "A dry Christmas tree is a fire hazard.", "description": "Now that Christmas has passed, here’s some tips to keep in mind.  Keep your tree watered! A dry tree is a fire hazard. When you’re ready to throw it away -place it curbside on the right day. See www.SWA.org   Remember to remove the decorations & lighting first. DON’T put it in the garage or LEAN your tree against the house. If the tree catches fire - your HOUSE will catch 🔥 Fire! Watch this #PBCFR demo to see how FAST the flames can spread. #YourSafetyOurPriority @pbcgov", "uploader": "Palm Beach County Fire Rescue", "uploader_id": "100067239866076", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-ord5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t15.5256-10/132098161_385149362579787_6336489722159005813_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx1280x720&ctp=s960x960&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=50ce42&_nc_ohc=pXBvpVsGVdIQ7kNvwGvEQjO&_nc_oc=AdoxOXoex6DfMKvHUPpez9gKAiehq7lJKgjzVHOzCL_R2k0ewAtmgia13ja50ndMVmI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.xx&_nc_gid=inOPDP59IqwrDZlwTvD0uA&_nc_ss=70289&oh=00_AQQ54gYxX_T9mlqOVCMtSZ8KOUx2Lmqh_2UJP3e35iSW5Q&oe=6AF061DA", "view_count": 1228, "concurrent_view_count": 0, "duration": 60.599, "id": "385148379246552", "formats": [{"format_id": "sd", "quality": -3, "url": "https://video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQNiPEKQsMvaH0USw1hR9cpM7UOtqX_mv7Ed35YKdVUvSqpTTQM3DfIZPHV7R1xSw8iLrL_qWfgAPG4kkm-ALAM.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=8bf8fe&_nc_ht=video-ord5-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=wHV0AlVXeL8Q7kNvwFV_up0&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5GQUNFQk9PSy4uQzMuNjQwLnN2ZV9zZCIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTE3NDE3NjM4MDIwODMxNSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjIxMzgsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMTIyLCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo2MCwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=inOPDP59IqwrDZlwTvD0uA&_nc_ss=70289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRIIKldWuEzHQhlbFzsalIyzCI5rzcVR2mCZmVx8efclA&oe=6AF05322&bitrate=964412&tag=sve_sd", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "facebookexternalhit/1.1", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language":